      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Form submitted\nA customer answered a form. `data.answers` lists each question with its `label` and `value`; `data.contact_id` and `data.ticket_id` say who and where. A typical next step: save the answers to your CRM or a sheet.",
        "width": 300,
        "height": 210,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "51e6ceef-29f6-4d82-808f-34474d071d65",
